POCKIT FUCK YOU LICENSE (PFYL)

The best code is code that is never written. The second best code is code we delete. The third best is code maintained by someone else. Yet this thing exists: the worst kind of code, the code maintained by Pockit Game Corp. 

## 0. Do whatever the fuck you want.

Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining this work to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, sell, and otherwise exploit the work, including commercially.

## 1. Freedom goes both ways.

By exercising the permissions granted by this license, you agree to grant everyone the same irrevocable, worldwide, royalty-free permissions to use, copy, modify, distribute, and commercially exploit your modifications and derivative contributions to the covered work.

You may keep your source code private, charge for access, and distribute proprietary products.

However, you may not assert copyright or other rights in your modifications to prevent anyone from exercising these permissions over those modifications once lawfully obtained.

## 2. Finders keepers.

You are not required to publish source code, disclose modifications, provide access to your work, or contribute anything upstream.

Others may independently recreate, inspect, or reverse engineer your modifications where legally permitted, and incorporate any lawfully obtained improvements into their own versions.

The reciprocal permissions in Section 1 apply regardless of whether those improvements were voluntarily shared.

## 3. No strings attached.

You do not need to include this license, preserve copyright notices, provide attribution, pay royalties, or ask permission.

You may sell your work, restrict access to your services, and choose how you distribute it.

You just cannot revoke the reciprocal permissions granted over your contributions to the covered work.

## 4. No promises.

THE WORK IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, AND NONINFRINGEMENT.

IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES, OR OTHER LIABILITY ARISING FROM THE USE OF THE WORK.

## 5. Fuck you, and have fun.

Build it. Fork it. Sell it. Hide it.

Just don't expect to own the improvements forever if someone else gets their hands on them.
